        {
          "channel": "chan-stderr",
          "operation": "op-apply",
          "assertion": {
            "contains": "Unknown template option"
          }
        }
      ],
      "cleanup": {
        "tempdir": true
      },
      "notes": "FR-040 unsupported class: an option name the template does not declare. The invocation is well-formed and the template is real; the option simply has nowhere to be substituted. deacon refuses rather than silently falling back to the declared default — the fallback would leave a user who mistyped an option with a successful run and the wrong configuration."
    }
  ]
